      ":question/problem": "![](images/a4/a4a1d43bc68a44db24d22767630573ebd9aafb646196e212640c24f2650e7b17.png)\n\nConsider the triangle $\u0394$ in the $uv$-plane, given by\n\n$$\n\u0394={(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le 1,\\,0\\le v\\le 1-u}.\n$$\n\nThe transformation $T$ is defined as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following gives the image of $\u0394$ in the $xy$-plane under the action of $T?$"
